        itemId = 43962,
        name = "White Polar Bear",
        mountCategory = "Quest Rewards",
        stepCount = 7,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Unlock Brunnhildar dailies and repeat random reward bags across daily resets.\n\n1. Travel to K3 in the Storm Peaks and find Gretchen Fizzlespark inside the large central building (41.1, 86.1). Enable Trivial Quests in tracking. Start They Took Our Men! and Leave No Goblin Behind; collect keys from the hostile inhabitants of Sifreldar Village to release the prisoners.\n\n2. Continue through The Crone's Bargain and Mildred the Cruel to enter the disguised Brunnhildar sequence. Finish Discipline, Examples to be Made, A Certain Prisoner, A Change of Scenery, and Is That Your Goblin? Follow each quest's marker rather than trying to speak to the undisguised hostile villagers.\n\n3. Continue The Hyldsmeet, Taking on All Challengers, You'll Need a Bear, Going Bearback, and Cold Hearted. During Cold Hearted, ride a captive proto-drake, free and collect three frozen prisoners at a time, then fly out of the quest area to deliver them.\n\n4. Complete Deemed Worthy and Making a Harness. At Hibernal Cavern (entrance about 56.0, 64.0), finish The Last of Her Kind and The Slithering Darkness; return for The Warm-Up and Into the Pit.\n\n5. Follow the chain through the bear competition, drake-riding challenge, and the Thorim introduction. Complete Mending Fences. Return to Gretta the Arbiter at Brunnhildar Village (50.9, 65.6) and check for a blue daily quest.\n\n6. Also visit the southern village hut around 48.4, 72.2. Complete Aberrations from Thyra Kvinnshal, then Off With Their Black Wings and Yulda's Folly from Astrid Bjornrittar where offered. These one-time quests unlock additional daily rotations. A missing daily can mean that its prerequisite is unfinished.\n\n7. Each day, complete every available Gretta daily that actually lists Hyldnir Spoils as its reward. Open each bag and learn Reins of the White Polar Bear if it appears. Repeat after the daily reset; unlocking additional characters gives additional daily attempts.",
