        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A rare drop with daily or weekly loot limits can require many repeated clears.\n\n1. Travel to Coldarra in Borean Tundra. Fly up to the Eye of Eternity portal on the upper ring of the Nexus structure (27.5, 26.6). The ground-level Nexus and the middle Oculus portals are different instances.\n\n2. Set a legacy 10- or 25-player raid size before entering and check your weekly raid lockout. You no longer need the original attunement key to activate the encounter.\n\n3. Use the focusing object in the room to summon Malygos. Defeat him and any transition enemies. If the dragon vehicle phase occurs, build combo points with Flame Spike and spend them on Engulf in Flames; use Revivify and Life Burst to recover and Flame Shield for the incoming surge. Stay on the vehicle and finish the encounter rather than leaving when the platform breaks.\n\n4. Wait for Alexstrasza and the reward chest. Loot Alexstrasza's Gift completely, including any mount reins. Use Reins of the Azure Drake if they appear.\n\n5. A failed attempt to get the reins does not unlock another loot roll on the same saved encounter. Return after the weekly reset, or use a different eligible character. Either color can appear on the same attempt.",
