        name = "Bronze Drake",
        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A high-level character can finish the Heroic timed event for a guaranteed mount.\n\n1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Heroic before entering. Go to the Caverns of Time in Tanaris (64.4, 50.0), descend into the cavern, and take the Culling of Stratholme portal (56.9, 82.4 on the Caverns of Time map).\n\n2. On a first visit, speak to Chromie, obtain the Arcane Disruptor, and reveal the five plagued grain crates around the approach to the city. Speak to Chromie again, then talk to Arthas at the city entrance to begin the event.\n\n3. Follow the minimap markers to each undead wave and kill both wave bosses. Keep talking to Arthas whenever his dialogue is required; waiting for him without starting the next segment wastes the timer.\n\n4. Escort Arthas through the Town Hall, kill Chrono-Lord Epoch, and continue through the tunnel and burning streets. Clear anything preventing the escort from advancing. You have 25 minutes from the timed event's start to reach the optional boss.\n\n5. At the end of the burning-street route, before committing to Mal'Ganis, take the side path into Market Row. Find the Infinite Corruptor beside a captive bronze drake and kill him before the timer expires.\n\n6. Loot Reins of the Bronze Drake from the Corruptor and use them. If several collectors are present, agree who gets the single mount. If the timer expires, try again on a different eligible character or after the Heroic reset.",
