        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Raise Wyrmrest Accord reputation to Exalted, then buy the guaranteed vendor reward.\n\n1. Quest for the Wyrmrest Accord in Dragonblight until at least Friendly. Visit Cielstrasza on the upper level of Wyrmrest Temple (59.8, 53.0); take a temple flight or fly up to her terrace.\n\n2. Buy and equip the Tabard of the Wyrmrest Accord. Enter an eligible Wrath dungeon on a character able to clear it, kill a few enemies, and confirm that the Wyrmrest Accord reputation bar increases. The tabard does not redirect reputation from arbitrary modern dungeons.\n\n3. Continue eligible dungeon clears to Exalted. Heroic Wrath dungeons provide a daily route; repeatable Normal clears of the Icecrown five-player dungeons are another option where their kills award tabard reputation. Reset Normal instances only after exiting, and respect the hourly instance limit.\n\n4. Return to Cielstrasza at Exalted, buy Reins of the Red Drake, and use the item. The displayed vendor price includes any applicable discount; bring 2,000 gold to cover the base price.",
