        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat Sartharion with all three drakes alive in the correct raid size; the mount is guaranteed.\n\n1. Outside the instance, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players. Fly to the ground-level chamber beneath Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight (about 59.6, 54.4) and enter the Obsidian Sanctum portal. Do not confuse it with the Ruby Sanctum.\n\n2. Clear only the ordinary trash you need to pass. Leave the three named twilight drakes on the surrounding ledges alive. Killing one before the pull removes the required three-drake condition for this attempt.\n\n3. Engage Sartharion directly with all three drakes still alive and defeat him quickly. On an overleveled Retail character, there is no need to reproduce old class cooldown rotations, raid compositions, or item-level requirements.\n\n4. If he becomes immune because the fight lasts long enough for Shadron's mechanics, handle the summoned drakes and their portal disciples. In a group, leave someone outside to maintain the encounter while another player enters the portal. Do not start by killing the drakes before Sartharion is engaged.\n\n5. Loot Reins of the Twilight Drake from Sartharion and learn the mount. The correctly completed three-drake encounter guarantees one mount for the group. Check the selected raid size if you received the other color.",
