        itemId = 44151,
        name = "Blue Proto-Drake",
        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A rare drop with daily or weekly loot limits can require many repeated clears.\n\n1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Heroic outside the instance. Fly to Utgarde Keep in Howling Fjord and use the upper Utgarde Pinnacle entrance (57.3, 46.7), not the lower Utgarde Keep portal.\n\n2. Follow the halls toward Skadi's gauntlet. You can pass Svala Sorrowgrave and Gortok Palehoof without starting their encounters; kill only trash blocking your route.\n\n3. Approach Skadi to start his flight on Grauf, then move along the gauntlet toward the harpoon launchers. Kill the Ymirjar Harpooners and loot at least three Harpoons from their corpses.\n\n4. Wait for Grauf to pass within harpoon range. Click a launcher repeatedly to fire the three Harpoons. Stay out of the blue freezing-breath lane while waiting for the next pass if necessary.\n\n5. When Skadi lands, kill him and loot his body. Learn Reins of the Blue Proto-Drake if it drops. Do not leave after shooting Grauf without looting Skadi.\n\n6. A Heroic boss kill gives one daily attempt per eligible character. Return after the daily reset or use another character; resetting the already-saved Heroic does not give another mount roll.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=44151",
        difficultyReason = "A rare drop with daily or weekly loot limits can require many repeated clears.",
        difficulty = "hard",
    },
