        name = "Plagued Proto-Drake",
        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Wait for a rare Black Market listing and win a potentially expensive auction against other bidders.\n\n1. Do not run the original 10-player Glory of the Raider meta expecting this mount: that reward was removed in patch 3.1. The current route is a rotating Black Market listing.\n\n2. On a character at the current maximum level, visit Madam Goya in Midnight Silvermoon City, Murder Row (51.8, 48.5). This is map 2393, not the Burning Crusade Silvermoon map or an old Dalaran auctioneer.\n\n3. Inspect the Black Market list for Reins of the Plagued Proto-Drake. If absent, check another day's inventory. If present, decide your maximum bid before bidding; there is no fixed gold price or guaranteed day for the listing.\n\n4. If bidding, monitor the auction until it ends. A bid does not reserve the mount against other bidders. On winning, retrieve the reins from your mailbox and use them.\n\n5. An Unclaimed Black Market Container can also contain the reins, but its contents are random. Buying a container is not a reliable way to target this particular drake.",
