        },
        itemId = 44223,
        name = "Black War Bear",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Defeat current enemy-faction leaders with a suitable group and account for city defenses and PvP interference.\n\n1. On an Alliance character, track For the Alliance! and open its required sub-achievements. The current Retail page requires Lor'themar Theron and Rokhan. Form a same-faction group with a tank and healer, agree on a War Mode setting, and gather before entering an enemy city.\n\n2. For Killed in Quel'Thalas, use the Burning Crusade version of Silvermoon City. At the northern Eastern Plaguelands border (53.9, 8.7), use Zidormi/the old-zone portal to reach Ghostlands and old Eversong. Continue north through the old zones; the modern neutral Silvermoon hub is not the leader encounter.\n\n3. Inside old Silvermoon, reach Sunfury Spire (about 54.0, 20.6). Clear interfering guards, keep the group together, defeat Lor'themar Theron, and confirm Killed in Quel'Thalas completed before leaving.\n\n4. Travel to Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength. Defeat the attackable Rokhan for Opposing Orgrimmar, keeping damage on the leader and controlling guards and enemy-player interference. Do not hunt an obsolete Thrall, Garrosh, or Saurfang version.\n\n5. Confirm For the Alliance! is complete, then check the Mount Journal and mailbox for the Alliance Black War Bear. Use any reins received. Additional old leader achievements are optional unless your current in-game checklist explicitly requires them.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=44223",
        difficultyReason = "Defeat current enemy-faction leaders with a suitable group and account for city defenses and PvP interference.",
        difficulty = "hard",
    },
    [60119] = {
