        itemId = 44413,
        name = "Mekgineer's Chopper",
        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 7,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Buy the crafted motorcycle or obtain its reputation recipe, materials and vendor parts.\n\n1. Use a Alliance character. For the quickest collection route, compare the finished Mekgineer's Chopper on the Auction House with the cost of its materials and a crafter's fee. Buying the completed mount does not require Engineering or reputation; if buying it, skip to the last step.\n\n2. To craft it yourself, learn Northrend Engineering and raise that expansion's skill to 75. Reach Exalted with Alliance Vanguard. Quest for its Northrend subfactions or earn their default reputation in eligible Wrath dungeons without a competing reputation tabard. Check that the parent faction's bar is increasing.\n\n3. Buy schematic item 44503 from Logistics Officer Brighton in Borean Tundra (59.6, 64.0) and learn it on the engineer. Merely having the materials does not unlock the restricted component vendor.\n\n4. Obtain 12 Titansteel Bars, 40 Handfuls of Cobalt Bolts, and 2 Arctic Fur. These are the finished crafting materials; do not mistake 40 Handfuls of Cobalt Bolts for 40 individual bolts or assume that a fixed amount of ore always produces them.\n\n5. With the schematic learned, visit Roxi Ramrocket at K3 in the Storm Peaks (40.7, 84.8). Buy one Salvaged Iron Golem Parts, eight Goblin-machined Pistons, and one Elementium-plated Exhaust Pipe. Their undiscounted total is 12,500 gold. The exhaust pipe can be limited stock; return later if it is unavailable.\n\n6. Craft the motorcycle at an anvil using all six material types. If another player is crafting it, agree on the materials and fee first; that engineer must buy any parts you cannot see on Roxi's vendor list.\n\n7. Use the finished Mekgineer's Chopper item to learn it. A party member can board the sidecar after you summon it. The passenger feature is part of the mount; it is not a separate recipe or reputation unlock.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=44413",
        difficultyReason = "Buy the crafted motorcycle or obtain its reputation recipe, materials and vendor parts.",
        difficulty = "medium",
    },
