        },
        itemId = 44707,
        name = "Green Proto-Drake",
        mountCategory = "Vendor",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Reach Oracles Revered, then repeat three-day eggs until the rare mount hatches.\n\n1. If the Oracles are not unlocked, take The Part-time Hunter from Tamara Wobblesprocket at Lakeside Landing (50.4, 62.0), kill Pitch near 50.5, 77.0, and accept Playing Along from Tracker Gekgek. Follow the Frenzyheart jobs through Hoofing It and Just Following Orders. Help the injured oracle, finish Fortunate Misunderstandings, and follow the Oracles story through The Angry Gorloc, The Mosswalker Savior, and Lifeblood of the Mosswalker Shrine to unlock A Hero's Burden. You initially help both factions; the permanent choice comes next.\n\n2. Enter the cave at 70.8, 58.7 and fight Artruis the Heartless. When his two captives become attackable, kill Zepik the Gorloc Hunter and keep Jaloot alive to choose the Oracles. Complete Jaloot's offered follow-up and return to Rainspeaker Canopy. If already aligned with Frenzyheart, this encounter also lets you switch sides.\n\n3. Do the Oracles dailies at Rainspeaker Canopy (about 54.6, 56.1) until Revered. Check each day's available quests; reaching Friendly is only the start, not enough to buy the egg.\n\n4. Buy one Mysterious Egg from Geen at Rainspeaker Canopy. Keep the unique egg in your inventory and wait three real days for it to become a Cracked Egg. You cannot speed the timer by remaining online.\n\n5. Open the Cracked Egg. If it contains Reins of the Green Proto-Drake, use them. Otherwise clear the opened egg and buy another one from Geen; repeat the three-day cycle. The pets and Aged Yolk are normal unsuccessful results.",
