        name = "Magnificent Flying Carpet",
        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Raise Northrend Tailoring and gather the required cloth, gems or Frozen Orbs for a personal craft.\n\n1. Learn Northrend Tailoring from Charles Worth in the tailoring shop in original Dalaran (36.5, 33.5). Raise that expansion's skill to 60; the old unsplit 425-point requirement is not a separate Retail skill to grind.\n\n2. Return to Charles and learn Magnificent Flying Carpet. Make sure your trainer filter shows available and unavailable recipes if you cannot find it.\n\n3. Collect 12 Bolts of Imbued Frostweave, 4 Monarch Topaz, 4 Red Dye, 2 Yellow Dye, and 4 Iceweb Spider Silk. Buy dyes from a tailoring-supplies vendor. The bolts can be crafted from Frostweave cloth and Infinite Dust or purchased directly.\n\n4. Craft the carpet on the tailor who will learn it, then use the item from that character's bags. Another tailor cannot hand you the bind-on-pickup finished mount.\n\n5. Search Collections > Mounts for Magnificent Flying Carpet. Keep Northrend Tailoring learned to summon it; learning it account-wide does not make it usable on non-tailor characters.",
